{"baseRefName":"main","body":"A Creator can author one reusable, versioned Environment and manage multiple independently saved Scenes from a single Scene Manager. Explicit Environment pins, per-Scene revision review, comparison, archive and an immutable future Chronicle reference preserve sibling and published-version stability.\n\nValidation: 34 focused and 85 existing regression tests pass at their recorded sources. Two additional comparison contract cases pass with nine existing Environment authoring checks; their product source is unchanged from a33780ae. Reviewed product source a33780ae passed a fresh production build with TypeScript, both actual browser journeys and the focused Scene Manager component check. The journeys cover Haunted Bedroom isolation/revision review and built-in/owned/reconstructed/source-Scene creation. Eleven desktop/mobile captures and independent supporting review3 preserve both prior reports and resolved findings, with no new scoped blocking finding. Protected, motion, full fallback and owner acceptance remain unclaimed.\n\nProtected integration is blocked: the experience planner selects crossdeck.phase2.continuity through shared Parallax consumers. Protected main has only its experienceIntent; the complete owning design remains in unmerged draft PR #721. Protected-main capture preparation [38681713940](https://github.com/Kgray44/treasurehuntSoT/actions/runs/38681713940) confirms the same exact design gate before new capture. This draft retains that obligation and claims no protected experience acceptance, owner acceptance or landed integration. No SC-03 integration or adjacent refit source is included. The PR #722 bridge at8e612f7a has a separate source-contract review and bounded comparison handoff (41 checks, lint/full TypeScript); its combined UI remains BLOCK_WITH_EVIDENCE with all three failed attempts retained. Shared-owned revision editing remains distinct from independent copying. This main-based candidate cleanly reconciles accepted diagnostic main99a2 with unchanged product source; read-only planning confirms the same Crossdeck design gate. Inactive proposal #731 requires its specific owner decision.\n\nImplementation and immutable Scene reference contract: [SC-01 record](Development_Docs/Projects/Project_Parallax/SC_01_Environment_and_Scene_Manager.md).\n\n## Documentation checklist\n\n- [x] User-visible feature documentation, current status, and feature status were reviewed.\n- [x] Changelog was updated when relevant.\n- [x] No automation instructions were added to human-facing documentation.\n- [x] Engineering records are indexed and current links are valid.\n- [x] npm run docs:validate passed.\n\nFeature Catalog: NO CHANGE REQUIRED (unaccepted branch; no completed capability promotion).\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T03:18:37Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T03:18:37Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add reusable Environment revisions and independent Scene management","oid":"b517648f0bd4a734056148f51b953ac70ad2f410"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T03:34:17Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T03:34:17Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Isolate Environment editing and preserve Scene save and preview state","oid":"ce32674cc7147ca46ed18628255bc0529423a337"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T03:43:40Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T03:43:40Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Preserve built-in Environment digests through production serialization","oid":"4d022dcf4e4688b033577e43593e400452c5e991"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T04:05:23Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T04